# Fetch journals are restart-safety scaffolding, not evidence: each is
# content-identical to its manifest (which IS digest-pinned in the
# governed record), and fetch order is recoverable from the manifest's
# fetched_at. Kept on disk, out of git.
investigations/*/evidence/*journal.ndjson

